{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2022-07-27 16:00:00', 'title': 'KEURIG AND BLK & BOLD COFFEE ANNOUNCE NEW K-CUP POD PARTNERSHIP', 'text': 'AGREEMENT MAKES AVAILABLE THE LARGEST BLACK-OWNED COFFEE BRAND TO THE 36 MILLION+ HOUSEHOLDS WITH A KEURIG BREWER BURLINGTON, MASS., FRISCO, TEXAS AND DES MOINES, IOWA , JULY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. (NASDAQ: KDP) AND BLK & BOLD SPECIALTY BEVERAGES TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF BLK & BOLD COFFEES IN K-CUP® PODS FOR THE KEURIG® BREWING SYSTEM.'}